{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu06", "cards": [{"id": "u4.t.protist", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PRO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tist<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"protist\" data-audio=\"audio/protist.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: protist\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-protist.webp\" width=\"618\" height=\"800\" alt=\"A few of the many kinds of protists, from seaweeds to single cells seen under a microscope.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A few of the many kinds of protists, from seaweeds to single cells seen under a microscope.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">原生生物种类繁多的几个例子：从海藻到显微镜下的单细胞生物。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Respectively: Claire Fackler, CINMS, NOAA, User:Wiedehopf20, Frank Fox, Patrick De Wever … · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Protist_collage_2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"protist\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Protist<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">eukaryote, not<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plant, animal or<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fungus<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Examples<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">amoeba, euglena,<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">kelp<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A eukaryote that is not an animal, a plant or a fungus. Most are single-celled.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>原生生物<\/b>：不属于动物、植物或真菌的真核生物，大多数是单细胞。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">proto- = first. The &quot;first&quot; eukaryotes.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">proto- = 最初：最早的真核生物。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Are all protists single-celled?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. Kelp is a multicellular protist.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.protozoan", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">to<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ZO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">an<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"protozoan\" data-audio=\"audio/protozoan.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: protozoan\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"protozoan\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Protozoan<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">single cell, eats<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">food<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Examples<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">amoeba, paramecium<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An animal-like protist that is single-celled and feeds on other organisms.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>原生动物<\/b>：单细胞、像动物一样以其他生物为食的原生生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">proto = first, zoo = animal. First animal-like cells.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">proto = 最初，zoo = 动物。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a protozoan make its own food?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It eats other organisms, like an animal.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.algae", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">AL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gae<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"algae\" data-audio=\"audio/algae.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: algae\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-algae.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Brown seaweeds. Seaweeds are large algae.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Brown seaweeds. Seaweeds are large algae.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">褐色海藻。海藻就是大型藻类。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Tomascastelazo · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seaweed_in_Ensenada_Baja_California.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"algae\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Algae<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis, no<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">roots or leaves<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Examples<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">diatoms, kelp,<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green algae<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>藻类<\/b>：通过光合作用制造食物的植物样原生生物。单数 alga。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">alga (singular), algae (plural).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">单数 alga，复数 algae。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Can algae photosynthesize?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. They contain chlorophyll.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.organelle", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">or<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ELLE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"organelle\" data-audio=\"audio/organelle.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: organelle\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"organelle\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"85\" ry=\"40\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"55\" r=\"16\" class=\"f4 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"52\" cy=\"66\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" class=\"f2 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"148\" cy=\"62\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" class=\"f3 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"10\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"12.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"38.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,38.0 97.8,33.5 102.2,33.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mitochondrion<\/text><line x1=\"52.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"52.0\" y2=\"76.0\"/><polygon points=\"52.0,76.0 54.2,80.5 49.8,80.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">chloroplast<\/text><line x1=\"148.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"148.0\" y2=\"72.0\"/><polygon points=\"148.0,72.0 150.2,76.5 145.8,76.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细胞器<\/b>：细胞内承担特定功能的小结构。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">organ + -elle (little). A little organ.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">organ + -elle（小）：细胞里的「小器官」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name one organelle.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Nucleus, mitochondrion or chloroplast, for example.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.nucleus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">NU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cle<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">us<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"nucleus\" data-audio=\"audio/nucleus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: nucleus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"nucleus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"62\" rx=\"80\" ry=\"44\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"62\" r=\"24\" class=\"f4 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">eukaryotic cell<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus = control centre<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The organelle that holds a eukaryotic cell&#x27;s DNA.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细胞核<\/b>：储存真核细胞 DNA 的细胞器。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">nucleus = Latin for kernel.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">nucleus 在拉丁语里是「果核」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does the nucleus contain?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The cell&#x27;s DNA.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.mitochondrion", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">mi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">to<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CHON<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">dri<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">on<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mitochondrion\" data-audio=\"audio/mitochondrion.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: mitochondrion\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mitochondrion\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"36\" class=\"f2 k\"/><path d=\"M45 60 Q60 40 70 60 Q80 80 95 60 Q110 40 120 60 Q135 80 155 60\" class=\"s\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"7.294832826747719\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">powerhouse: food + oxygen becomes usable energy<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">folded inner membrane<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"45.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,45.0 97.8,40.5 102.2,40.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>线粒体<\/b>：从食物中释放能量供细胞使用的细胞器，复数 mitochondria。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mito = thread, chondrion = granule. Think &quot;mighty mitochondria: powerhouse&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线粒体 = 细胞的「发电站」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which organelle releases energy from food?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The mitochondrion.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.chloroplast", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CHLO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">plast<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"chloroplast\" data-audio=\"audio/chloroplast.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: chloroplast\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-chloroplast.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Leaf cells of the water plant Elodea under a microscope. The green dots are chloroplasts.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Leaf cells of the water plant Elodea under a microscope. The green dots are chloroplasts.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的伊乐藻叶细胞。绿色小点就是叶绿体。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Juan Carlos Fonseca Mata · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chloroplasts_-_Microscopic_view_of_Elodea_canadensis.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"chloroplast\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"36\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"70\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"6\" class=\"f6\"/><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"6\" class=\"f6\"/><ellipse cx=\"130\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"6\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">sunlight + CO2 + water becomes sugar<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The organelle where photosynthesis happens. It contains green chlorophyll.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>叶绿体<\/b>：进行光合作用的细胞器，含有绿色的叶绿素。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">chloro = green, plast = form.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">chloro = 绿色。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which organelle carries out photosynthesis?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The chloroplast.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u4.t.protist", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A eukaryote that is not an animal, a plant or a fungus. Most are single-celled.”<\/i>", "opts": ["nucleus", "dinoflagellate", "protist", "phytoplankton"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>protist<\/b>: A eukaryote that is not an animal, a plant or a fungus. Most are single-celled. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">原生生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.protozoan", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An animal-like protist that is single-celled and feeds on other organisms.”<\/i>", "opts": ["kelp", "euglena", "Plasmodium", "protozoan"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>protozoan<\/b>: An animal-like protist that is single-celled and feeds on other organisms. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">原生动物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.algae", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae.”<\/i>", "opts": ["algal bloom", "algae", "photosynthesis", "diatom"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>algae<\/b>: Plant-like protists that make food by photosynthesis. One alga, many algae. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">藻类<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.organelle", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job.”<\/i>", "opts": ["endosymbiotic theory", "nucleus", "organelle", "red tide"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>organelle<\/b>: A small structure inside a cell that does a specific job. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细胞器<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.nucleus", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The organelle that holds a eukaryotic cell&#x27;s DNA.”<\/i>", "opts": ["slime mold", "red tide", "nucleus", "colonial organism"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>nucleus<\/b>: The organelle that holds a eukaryotic cell&#x27;s DNA. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细胞核<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.mitochondrion", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria.”<\/i>", "opts": ["flagellate", "amoeba", "slime mold", "mitochondrion"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mitochondrion<\/b>: The organelle that releases energy from food for the cell. Plural: mitochondria. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线粒体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.chloroplast", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The organelle where photosynthesis happens. It contains green chlorophyll.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mitochondrion", "phytoplankton", "chloroplast", "red tide"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>chloroplast<\/b>: The organelle where photosynthesis happens. It contains green chlorophyll. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">叶绿体<\/span>", "whys": null}]}